{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13206310","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13206310","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:1:1320631001:0":{"text":"위빙 머신이 작동하자, 금속이 마찰하는 듯한 소리가 들려왔다","source_cn":"织言机启动了，起初像是金属缓慢摩擦的声音","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51270DF2C3FE0752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1320631002:1":{"text":"하지만 목소리는 익숙해질 때까지 점차 다급해져 갔다","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216AD4406A6464D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320631003:1":{"text":"후... 후... 움직여, 더 빨리! 캐롤이 아직 수도원에 있어. 몬스터가 다른 성당을 뚫었다는 걸 모르고 있을 거야!","source_cn":"呼……呼……动起来，再快一点！小卡莎还在修道院，她不知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30E8C5166ED4AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320631004:1":{"text":"삐... 걱...","source_cn":"吱……咯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E92B94EBF43DC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320631005:1":{"text":"오빠... 카렌 오빠!","source_cn":"哥哥——铐兰哥哥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x254718E76D90D75F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320631006:1":{"text":"오빠 목소리에요! 그가 수도원으로 날 찾으러 오기 전일까요...?","source_cn":"这是哥哥的声音！是他去修道院找我之前……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CBABD4C39D77AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320631007:1":{"text":"캐롤... 다... 다친 거야?","source_cn":"卡莎，你……你受伤了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08969B9F9187EB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320631008:1":{"text":"나... 나도 모르겠어, 오빠, 무슨 일이 일어난 거야?","source_cn":"我……我不知道，哥哥，发生了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x575E086E80945584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320631009:1":{"text":"듀라신이시여...","source_cn":"艾雅在上——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10BC436F003B8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320631010:0":{"text":"카렌의 목소리는 날카로운 비명과 거대한 폭발음에 파묻혔다. 화약이 터지고, 건물이 무너지면서 먼지가 비 오듯 떨어지는 소리였다.","source_cn":"铐兰的声音被尖锐而巨大的爆破声淹没，那是火药爆炸、建筑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE9BBF2063FE6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320631011:1":{"text":"그 소리 뒤에 들려온 것은 우리도 들어보았던 몬스터의 울부짖는 소리, 다급한 숨소리, 그리고 달려가는